# Timecourse example: derived inputs are generated, and so is every run after the first.
# report/v1/ is committed - it is the output of one run, kept so the example can be read
# without being run. A local re-run lands in v2, v3, ... and stays out of the repository.
examples/Timecourse_HMSLINCS_MCF10A_2016/prepared/
examples/Timecourse_HMSLINCS_MCF10A_2016/report/*
!examples/Timecourse_HMSLINCS_MCF10A_2016/report/v1/
